OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged after over death of
OL,4,Aman in suspected shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged in connection
OL,7,Fwith the death of a man who was killed
OL,8,Fin a suspected shooting in West
OL,9,FLothian.
OL,11,FBilly Watson, 35, was found with
OL,12,Finjuries after police were called to a
OL,13,Fproperty on Harestanes Road in Armadale
OL,14,Fat about 11:50 on Saturday but died at
OL,15,Fthe scene.
OL,17,FHis death is being treated as murder
OL,18,Ffollowing a post-mortem examination.
OL,20,FA 57-year-old man is due to appear at
OL,21,FLivingston Sheriff Court on Friday and
OL,22,Fpolice said inquiries were ongoing.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
